# Shared settings for every demo: a fixed window, the pictures' font, a
# widely used color scheme, and a pace that reads well. A tape sets its
# own scheme after this one when its pages are in another family
# (docs/contributing/site.md#font-and-colors); make demos sets 012's
# theme to the same scheme. Tapes run from demos/, so the binary is
# ../bin/012.
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontFamily "JetBrains Mono"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1000
Set Height 600
Set Padding 20
Set LineHeight 1.15
Set TypingSpeed 55ms
Set CursorBlink false
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
